    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become an aircraft mechanic during World War I:</strong></h2>As an aircraft mechanic, your main task is to maintain the efficiency and reliability of the flying machines serviced in the hangar. Repairing and maintaining planes in the chaos of battle is not an easy task, in the game, you will have to face many challenges<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/27d95699553377a283a34cd008c4e7ae.poster.avif?t=1731662111\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/27d95699553377a283a34cd008c4e7ae.webm?t=1731662111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/27d95699553377a283a34cd008c4e7ae.mp4?t=1731662111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage, repair and modernize planes:</strong></h2>In war conditions, your actions may have a crucial impact on the course of the mission and the fate of pilots. Therefore, you must always be vigilant, effective, and responsible. There is no time for boredom in the hangar because there are always new challenges and problems to solve.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/05c1c21afa5471a047be5317b66ad47c.poster.avif?t=1731662111\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/05c1c21afa5471a047be5317b66ad47c.webm?t=1731662111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/05c1c21afa5471a047be5317b66ad47c.mp4?t=1731662111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop your hangar:</strong></h2>Your journey as a mechanic is one of constant development. The ability to adapt is crucial when navigating changing plans and unforeseen events. Your knowledge will evolve with your military rank, giving you the respect and recognition you deserve among the Air Force<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/7a81ea771371cfd465a2cfd7abeaa3f7.poster.avif?t=1731662111\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/7a81ea771371cfd465a2cfd7abeaa3f7.webm?t=1731662111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/7a81ea771371cfd465a2cfd7abeaa3f7.mp4?t=1731662111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic military experience:</strong></h2>Feel the pressure and tension of war operations. Develop and cooperate with other mechanics and supply officers, the fate of the sky machines depends on your decisions. Thanks to a promotion system based on authentic military ranks, your contribution will influence the outcome of the conflict.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/12565762587bb1370e39deac01e8cb4a.poster.avif?t=1731662111\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/12565762587bb1370e39deac01e8cb4a.webm?t=1731662111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/12565762587bb1370e39deac01e8cb4a.mp4?t=1731662111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become an aircraft mechanic during World War I:</strong></h2>As an aircraft mechanic, your main task is to maintain the efficiency and reliability of the flying machines serviced in the hangar. Repairing and maintaining planes in the chaos of battle is not an easy task, in the game, you will have to face many challenges<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/27d95699553377a283a34cd008c4e7ae.poster.avif?t=1731662111\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/27d95699553377a283a34cd008c4e7ae.webm?t=1731662111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/27d95699553377a283a34cd008c4e7ae.mp4?t=1731662111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage, repair and modernize planes:</strong></h2>In war conditions, your actions may have a crucial impact on the course of the mission and the fate of pilots. Therefore, you must always be vigilant, effective, and responsible. There is no time for boredom in the hangar because there are always new challenges and problems to solve.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/05c1c21afa5471a047be5317b66ad47c.poster.avif?t=1731662111\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/05c1c21afa5471a047be5317b66ad47c.webm?t=1731662111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/05c1c21afa5471a047be5317b66ad47c.mp4?t=1731662111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop your hangar:</strong></h2>Your journey as a mechanic is one of constant development. The ability to adapt is crucial when navigating changing plans and unforeseen events. Your knowledge will evolve with your military rank, giving you the respect and recognition you deserve among the Air Force<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/7a81ea771371cfd465a2cfd7abeaa3f7.poster.avif?t=1731662111\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/7a81ea771371cfd465a2cfd7abeaa3f7.webm?t=1731662111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/7a81ea771371cfd465a2cfd7abeaa3f7.mp4?t=1731662111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic military experience:</strong></h2>Feel the pressure and tension of war operations. Develop and cooperate with other mechanics and supply officers, the fate of the sky machines depends on your decisions. Thanks to a promotion system based on authentic military ranks, your contribution will influence the outcome of the conflict.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/12565762587bb1370e39deac01e8cb4a.poster.avif?t=1731662111\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/12565762587bb1370e39deac01e8cb4a.webm?t=1731662111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886420/extras/12565762587bb1370e39deac01e8cb4a.mp4?t=1731662111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
